{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1690804,\"title\":\"EMOTIONS\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zkSzrHiNfdIeHJ9Lg3aVuZszfdt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":2025,\"runtime\":0,\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Music\",\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"FR\",\"name\":\"France\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Théo Georges\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":6199146,\"name\":\"Théo Georges\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":4522416,\"name\":\"Angela Sichanh\",\"character\":\"Loïs\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":6018094,\"name\":\"Orlane Giraudet\",\"character\":\"Sophie\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":6199122,\"name\":\"Lilya Le Corre\",\"character\":\"Clara\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":6199130,\"name\":\"Ludovic Herve\",\"character\":\"Marco\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":6199133,\"name\":\"Antoine Radzikowski\",\"character\":\"Mathias\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":27,\"title\":\"9 Songs\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/91O7z0vo7MiNWd5xD2BoivwbQsb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bybAHw5fenKXRFI4phanPhpljlT.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Matt, a young glaciologist, soars across the vast, silent, icebound immensities of the South Pole as he recalls his love affair with Lisa. They meet at a mobbed rock concert in a vast music hall - London's Brixton Academy. They are in bed at night's end. Together, over a period of several months, they pursue a mutual sexual passion whose inevitable stages unfold in counterpoint to nine live-concert songs.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":776503,\"title\":\"CODA\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/BzVjmm8l23rPsijLiNLUzuQtyd.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v85FlkbMYKa5du1glm0YfYNsL2n.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"As a CODA (Child of Deaf Adults), Ruby is the only hearing person in her deaf family. When the family's fishing business is threatened, Ruby finds herself torn between pursuing her love of music and her fear of abandoning her parents.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":332562,\"title\":\"A Star Is Born\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wrFpXMNBRj2PBiN4Z5kix51XaIZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dDYpjrwh1wNVQk0rEpc9P81wQt4.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Seasoned musician Jackson Maine discovers — and falls in love with — struggling artist Ally. She has just about given up on her dream to make it big as a singer — until Jack coaxes her into the spotlight. But even as Ally's career takes off, the personal side of their relationship is breaking down, as Jack fights an ongoing battle with his own internal demons.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":824,\"title\":\"Moulin Rouge!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2kjM5CUZRIU5yOANUowrbJcRL9L.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vvcLSgiviCIU0J0UcwLqWdU8Iup.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A celebration of love and creative inspiration takes place in the infamous, gaudy and glamorous Parisian nightclub, at the cusp of the 20th century. A young poet, who is plunged into the heady world of Moulin Rouge, begins a passionate affair with the club's most notorious and beautiful star.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":69,\"title\":\"Walk the Line\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p8lPTjvjOjTfvC1E9pmMwcF9vkn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pMBKzEotLUzk3NuQiyVjZEDlH70.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A chronicle of country music legend Johnny Cash's life, from his early days on an Arkansas cotton farm to his rise to fame with Sun Records in Memphis, where he recorded alongside Elvis Presley, Jerry Lee Lewis and Carl Perkins.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":6282,\"title\":\"Coyote Ugly\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xYM0laKrEqjiRSQNvqRrXPXN3iL.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f2MzXz3vjuNtSPn17ugFa6oTUmc.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Graced with a velvet voice, 21-year-old Violet Sanford heads to New York to pursue her dream of becoming a songwriter only to find her aspirations sidelined by the accolades and notoriety she receives at her \\\"day\\\" job as a barmaid at Coyote Ugly. The \\\"Coyotes\\\" as they are affectionately called tantalize customers and the media alike with their outrageous antics, making Coyote Ugly the watering hole for guys on the prowl.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":8328,\"title\":\"Step Up 2: The Streets\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vYdlRTvA5fneB88NchV3sirzCE1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/h87R0iJBcUYcIOE2GEVEcpwtBd9.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When rebellious street dancer Andie West lands at the elite Maryland School of the Arts, she finds herself fighting to fit in while also trying to hold onto her old life. When she joins forces with the school's hottest dancer, Chase Collins, to form a crew of fellow outcasts to compete in Baltimore's underground dance battle The Streets.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":68817,\"title\":\"Footloose\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cDUW5RWmyHcTxu7eg9eMqhBQy2J.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fW1GatD12zbltefRvKR6b4iouQp.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ren MacCormack is transplanted from Boston to the small southern town of Bomont where loud music and dancing are prohibited. Not one to bow to the status quo, Ren challenges the ban, revitalizing the town and falling in love with the minister’s troubled daughter Ariel in the process.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":243,\"title\":\"High Fidelity\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e2LZGB62GMhv3Fo8tDZjY87I81a.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tmP4COlAaowO0FniW30aatOcmMq.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After his long-time girlfriend dumps him, a thirty-year-old record store owner seeks to understand why he is unlucky in love while recounting his \\\"top five breakups of all time\\\".\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":198277,\"title\":\"Begin Again\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qx4HXHXt528hS4rwePZbZo20xqZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xrSRmL6pXnRfu9vKwayILkNgLP.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Gretta, a budding songwriter, finds herself alone after her boyfriend Dave ditches her. Her life gains purpose when Dan, a record label executive, notices her talent.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"wuzc-a7dAqM\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"lKbcKQN5Yrw\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"qub8lZlVlho\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}